@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
#@baseUrl = https://<your-app>.azurewebsites.net

# Function key — leave blank for local (the local host does not enforce keys).
# For a deployed app, set it and it will be appended as ?code={{code}}.
@code =


### List — one cheap call summarising every pipeline (enabled, cadence, last run, next due)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data-collection?code={{code}}


### Detailed status — the §2.2 envelope (scheduling + normalized progress) wrapping the pipeline body under `detail`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data-collection/activity_log/status?code={{code}}


### Run history — root-only rows, newest first; running rows enriched live. Page with limit + after (RowKey continuation).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data-collection/activity_log/run-history?limit=50&code={{code}}


### Edit config — change cadence/enablement without a restart (optimistic concurrency).
### expectedRevision must match the row's current Revision (from the list above); 0/absent for a new row.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/data-collection/cr_usage/config?code={{code}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "frequencySeconds": 86400,
  "anchorSeconds": 23400,
  "expectedRevision": 0
}


### Disable a pipeline (schedule stops; data is left untouched). Subscription Reference refuses with 409.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/data-collection/zone_mapping/config?code={{code}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false,
  "frequencySeconds": 0,
  "anchorSeconds": 0,
  "expectedRevision": 0
}
